{"slug": "new-owners-for-46m-superyacht-excellence", "title": "New owners for 46m superyacht Excellence", "description": "The 45.7-metre Richmond motor yacht Excellence has been sold. The deal was concluded by Alex G. Clarke of Denison Yachting who represented the seller, and Arney Mendez of Florida Yachts International who introduced the buyer.", "date": "2022-09-14", "category": "Boat Listing", "image": "https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/46-1.png", "html": "<p>Written by Francesca Webster<br/>21 June 2021 | 01:30 ()</p><p>The 45.7-metre <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/companies/richmond\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Richmond</a> motor yacht <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/yachts/excellence-46m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>Excellence</em></a> has been sold. The deal was concluded by Alex G. Clarke of <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/companies/denison-yachting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Denison Yachting</a> who represented the seller, and Arney Mendez of <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/companies/florida-yachts-international-fyi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Florida Yachts International</a> who introduced the buyer.</p><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/46-1.png\" alt=\"New owners for 46m superyacht Excellence\" loading=\"lazy\" /><p>Built in 2010, <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/yachts/excellence-46m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>Excellence</em></a>, ex. <em>Status Quo</em>, features exterior design by <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/companies/setzer-yacht-architects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Setzer</a>, while her interior was penned by <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/companies/pavlik-design-team\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pavlik Design Team</a>. <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/yachts/excellence-46m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>Excellence</em></a> can accommodate as many as 10 guests between five guest cabins.</p><p>Her interior is complete in mahogany with a satin finish, and her stateroom layout includes a full-beam master suite on the main deck, and four additional staterooms on the lower deck, all with en suite bathrooms.</p><p>Externally, she features al fresco lounge and dining options on each of her three decks, a Jacuzzi for eight guests and a touch-and-go helipad.</p><p>The motor yacht <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/yachts/excellence-46m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><em>Excellence</em></a>, sold, is powered by twin 2,000hp <a href=\"https://www.superyachttimes.com/companies/mtu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MTU</a> diesel engines and cruises at 16 knots and reaches a top speed of 18 knots, and her guests are taken care of by a crew of 9. She had a last known asking price of $16,995,000.</p><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198943-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198943-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198941-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198941-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198944-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198944-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198901-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198901-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198897-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198897-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198895-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198895-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198949-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198949-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198947-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198947-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a><a href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198925-l.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/09/SYT_198925-l-400x284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /> </a>"}